graph TD
    H_HUB[/"Hotels Hub<br/>/hotels"\] --> H_DEST[Destination Input]
    H_HUB --> H_CHECKIN[Check-in Date]
    H_HUB --> H_CHECKOUT[Check-out Date]
    H_HUB --> H_ROOMS[Rooms/Guests]
    H_HUB --> H_SEARCH_BTN[Search Submit]

    H_SEARCH_BTN --> H_VALIDATION{Validation}
    H_VALIDATION -->|Valid| H_SEARCH[Hotel Search<br/>/hotels/search]
    H_VALIDATION -->|Invalid| H_ERROR[Validation Error]

    H_SEARCH --> H_RESULTS[Hotel Results]
    H_RESULTS --> H_PROP_CARD[Property Card Click]
    H_PROP_CARD --> H_PROPERTY[Property Detail<br/>/hotels/property/:id]

    H_PROPERTY --> H_ROOM[Select Room Category]
    H_PROPERTY --> H_RATE[Select Rate Plan]
    H_PROPERTY --> H_CONFIG[Configure Stay]
    H_CONFIG --> H_STAGE[Stage as needs_action]
    H_STAGE --> H_TB[Trip Bucket Drawer]

    H_RESULTS --> H_NO_RESULTS[No Results State]
    H_NO_RESULTS --> H_MODIFY[Modify Search]

    H_TB --> H_REVIEW_CTA[Review Trip CTA]
    H_REVIEW_CTA --> H_REVIEW[Trip Review<br/>/trip/review]